<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo industry job data to be released monthly.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo industry job data to be released monthly.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo State Industry Federation (Fiesp) said it will begin releasing job figures only on a monthly basis as of this week.</p>
<p>It said in a statement job figures will be released in the second week of each month.</p>
<p>According to Fiesp, it will give analysts more time to consolidate information and analyse the data.</p>
<p>Previously, Fiesp released job figures weekly basis on Tuesday mornings.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
